You'll find plenty of ammo, health and armor. Enemies are weaker and less numerous. Keys, important texts and locations that require quest items are marked on the map, making for easier exploration and puzzle solving.
Normal difficulty, recommended for most players. Enemies are slightly less resilient, and ammo is slightly more plentiful. Important readables are marked on the map, aiding with exploration and puzzle solving.
Enemies have full strength and you'll have to better manage your ammo and consumables. Important texts have highlighted keywords to aid with puzzles and exploration. Recommended for skilled players.
Enemies deal 50% more damage and there is less ammo laying in the open. Exploration and puzzles are as challenging as they can be. Fit for those who really want to test their survival skill and wit.
A chaotic difficulty that shifts gameplay towards more combat and carnage. There are new monster spawns, higher tier enemies appear earlier and are stronger and more aggressive than usual. However, you also get the weapons, consumables and ammo required to put them down. You may also encounter a few additional companions along the way.
You can't use guns, but you get access to a new set of melee weapons to help you overcome this challenge! Monster strength is normal but spawns are similar to Brutalizing. You may also find a few additional companions. Perfect for second playthroughs.
You'll find plenty of ammo, health and armor. Enemies are less resilient and powerful, making for easier fights. Keys, important locations and readables are marked on the map.
Normal difficulty, recommended for most players. Enemies are slightly less resilient, and you'll find a bit more ammo. Important readables are marked on the map.
Enemies have full strength and you'll have to better manage your ammo and consumables. Recommended for skilled players.
Enemies deal 50% more damage and you will find less ammo around. Progression hints are no longer highlighted in readables. Fit for those who really want to challenge their survival skill and wit.
A chaotic difficulty that shifts gameplay towards more combat and carnage. There are new monster spawns, higher tier enemies appear earlier and are stronger and more aggressive than usual. However, you also get the weapons, consumables and ammo required to put them down. You also have the chance to encounter a couple of companions along the way.
You can't use guns, but you get access to a new set of melee weapons to help you overcome this challenge! Monster strength is normal but spawns are similar to Brutalizing.
